# arms/adult/action/twohand/bow_r: the archer's right (draw) arm, with the nocked arrow, both bodies (P2c SLICE-ARMS
# 2026-10-23; STYLE_P2 25.8 items 6 and 11). Keys: bw_low (the drawn idle, walk and run: the bow low in the left hand, an
# arrow nocked), bw_nock (the arrow to the string, the bow raised), bw_draw (to the chest), bw_full (to the cheek: the
# anchor, the bow arm straight, the elbow up), bw_rel (the string snaps: the draw hand flies back, the arrow gone: the
# projectile is the game's; the bow hand recoils a pixel). The side draw arm is A3's horizontal sword arm (sw_r1) set
# on the nock; the bow arm its far twin, straight at the target. Facing left repainted, never the plain mirror. The
# right fist marks `grip` on the nock (the arrow is part of this drawing); the left `gripL` holds the bow
# (held/weapons/bow_self, origin gripL). Regions U F C H (the archer's bracers and gloves). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
body adult
role arms std
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

